<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <style>
    body {
      font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
      line-height: 1.6;
      color: #1a1a1a;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      background-color: #f5f5f5;
    }
    .container {
      max-width: 600px;
      margin: 40px auto;
      background: #ffffff;
      border-radius: 12px;
      overflow: hidden;
      box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);
      border: 1px solid #eeeeee;
    }
    .header {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #636b2f 0%, #4f5625 100%);
      padding: 40px 30px 36px;
      text-align: center;
      color: #ffffff;
    }
    .header-eyebrow {
      font-size: 11px;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: 2px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      opacity: 0.75;
      margin: 0 0 10px 0;
    }
    .header h1 {
      margin: 0 0 8px 0;
      font-size: 30px;
      font-weight: 800;
    }
    .header p {
      margin: 0;
      font-size: 15px;
      opacity: 0.88;
    }
    .content {
      padding: 36px 30px 28px;
    }
    .steps-title {
      font-size: 13px;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: 0.5px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: #636b2f;
      margin: 0 0 20px 0;
    }
    .step-row {
      display: flex;
      align-items: flex-start;
      margin-bottom: 18px;
    }
    .step-number {
      flex-shrink: 0;
      width: 28px;
      height: 28px;
      background: #636b2f;
      color: #ffffff;
      border-radius: 50%;
      font-size: 13px;
      font-weight: 800;
      text-align: center;
      line-height: 28px;
      margin-right: 14px;
      margin-top: 2px;
    }
    .step-text strong {
      display: block;
      font-size: 15px;
      color: #1a1a1a;
    }
    .step-text span {
      font-size: 13px;
      color: #666666;
    }
    .cta-section {
      text-align: center;
      margin: 32px 0 8px;
    }
    .btn-primary {
      display: inline-block;
      padding: 15px 36px;
      background-color: #636b2f;
      color: #ffffff;
      text-decoration: none;
      border-radius: 6px;
      font-weight: 700;
      font-size: 16px;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 12px rgba(99,107,47,0.3);
    }
    .support-note {
      background: #f9fff3;
      border: 1px solid #bac095;
      border-radius: 8px;
      padding: 16px 20px;
      text-align: center;
      font-size: 13px;
      color: #555;
      margin-top: 28px;
    }
    .support-note a {
      color: #636b2f;
      font-weight: 700;
      text-decoration: none;
    }
    .footer {
      text-align: center;
      padding: 20px 30px;
      background-color: #f9fafb;
      color: #888888;
      font-size: 12px;
      border-top: 1px solid #eeeeee;
    }
    .footer a { color: #636b2f; text-decoration: none; }
  </style>
</head>
<body style="margin:0; padding:0; background-color:#f5f5f5;">

  <div class="container" style="background-color:#ffffff;">

    <div class="header" style="background:linear-gradient(135deg,#636b2f 0%,#4f5625 100%); padding:40px 30px 36px; text-align:center; color:#ffffff;">
      <p class="header-eyebrow" style="font-size:11px; font-weight:700; letter-spacing:2px; text-transform:uppercase; opacity:0.75; margin:0 0 10px 0;">Welcome aboard</p>
      <h1 style="margin:0 0 8px 0; font-size:30px; font-weight:800;">Hi {{firstName}}, you're in! 🎉</h1>
      <p style="margin:0; font-size:15px; opacity:0.88;">Your FormaChat account is ready. Let's build your first AI agent.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="content" style="padding:36px 30px 28px;">

      <p style="font-size:16px; margin:0 0 28px 0; color:#1a1a1a;">
        You've joined a platform that lets you deploy AI-powered customer support in minutes — trained on your own data, live 24/7. Here's how to get started:
      </p>

      <p class="steps-title" style="font-size:13px; font-weight:700; letter-spacing:0.5px; text-transform:uppercase; color:#636b2f; margin:0 0 20px 0;">3 steps to your first AI agent</p>

      <table style="width:100%; border-collapse:collapse;">
        <tr>
          <td style="vertical-align:top; width:42px; padding-bottom:18px;">
            <div style="width:28px; height:28px; background:#636b2f; color:#fff; border-radius:50%; font-size:13px; font-weight:800; text-align:center; line-height:28px;">1</div>
          </td>
          <td style="vertical-align:top; padding-bottom:18px; padding-left:2px;">
            <strong style="display:block; font-size:15px; color:#1a1a1a;">Create your business profile</strong>
            <span style="font-size:13px; color:#666;">Add your name, hours, products, FAQs, and tone.</span>
          </td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td style="vertical-align:top; width:42px; padding-bottom:18px;">
            <div style="width:28px; height:28px; background:#636b2f; color:#fff; border-radius:50%; font-size:13px; font-weight:800; text-align:center; line-height:28px;">2</div>
          </td>
          <td style="vertical-align:top; padding-bottom:18px; padding-left:2px;">
            <strong style="display:block; font-size:15px; color:#1a1a1a;">Upload your knowledge</strong>
            <span style="font-size:13px; color:#666;">Menus, PDFs, policies, images — your AI learns from all of it.</span>
          </td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td style="vertical-align:top; width:42px;">
            <div style="width:28px; height:28px; background:#636b2f; color:#fff; border-radius:50%; font-size:13px; font-weight:800; text-align:center; line-height:28px;">3</div>
          </td>
          <td style="vertical-align:top; padding-left:2px;">
            <strong style="display:block; font-size:15px; color:#1a1a1a;">Embed the chat widget</strong>
            <span style="font-size:13px; color:#666;">One snippet. Works on any website. Your AI is live.</span>
          </td>
        </tr>
      </table>

      <div class="cta-section" style="text-align:center; margin:32px 0 8px;">
        <a href="https://formachat.com/#/dashboard" class="btn-primary"
           style="display:inline-block; padding:15px 36px; background-color:#636b2f; color:#ffffff; text-decoration:none; border-radius:6px; font-weight:700; font-size:16px; box-shadow:0 4px 12px rgba(99,107,47,0.3);">
          Create My First Agent →
        </a>
      </div>

      <div class="support-note" style="background:#f9fff3; border:1px solid #bac095; border-radius:8px; padding:16px 20px; text-align:center; font-size:13px; color:#555; margin-top:28px;">
        Need help getting set up? We're here.<br>
        <a href="mailto:support@formachat.com" style="color:#636b2f; font-weight:700; text-decoration:none;">support@formachat.com</a>
      </div>

    </div>

    <div class="footer" style="text-align:center; padding:20px 30px; background-color:#f9fafb; color:#888; font-size:12px; border-top:1px solid #eee;">
      <p style="margin:4px 0;">&copy; {{currentYear}} FormaChat. All rights reserved.</p>
      <p style="margin:4px 0; color:#aaa;">If you didn't create this account, you can safely ignore this email.</p>
    </div>

  </div>
</body>
</html>
